      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SEERESS (8) demolished a handy field over 2110m at Lismore two starts back, then started a firm $2.80 fav with an out-of-character seventh over 1900m at Kilcoy. Complete mystery last start and she has the ability to bounce back over this trip with the senior rider engaged. CONTRERAS (10) finds a very average contest and has an okay record at this track and trip. Went back from the draw and failed to get into the contest when fifth over 2110m at Lismore. Has the right ratings to take this out. WOODLAND WONDER (7) has found form at his last two outings and doesn't have to improve much to take this out. Both wins have come at this track and he gets every chance today. SOUND AND VISION (2) is experiencing a long win drought, and the extra trip is in his favour with the claim. Assess on the narrow second at Tuncurry two back.",
